		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Smoke Screen</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Blanket an area in vision-blocking smoke.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions.</strong> Range 6, Line 6 or Blast 4. The area fills with thick smoke for 1 minute or until dispersed. It obscures vision and can't be seen through.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Affects all adjacent spaces as well.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You can see through smoke and other gases.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Extend the smoke one space around the area.</em></p>",
